                                "sense_id": "625de73e-f8cf-37e1-b8a9-aec83e85dea5",
                                "text": "12 is evenly divisible by 2, 3, 4 and 6.",
                                "translation": "2, 3, 4 et 6 sont des diviseurs entiers de 12."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "140f2136-98c4-4e53-8c3f-259eb0cc4815",
                                "sense_id": "625de73e-f8cf-37e1-b8a9-aec83e85dea5",
                                "text": "A proper divisor of a positive integer, n, is a positive integer less that n which divides evenly into n."
